. Wat begint als een kort contact krijgt onverwachte gevolgen wanneer ze ontdekt dat ze zwanger is. Het vierde Chestnut Springs-boek volgt hun moeizame communicatie en de vraag hoe twee mensen die elkaar nauwelijks kennen verantwoordelijkheid en een mogelijke relatie vormgeven.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1829946/roekeloos.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789493169098","key":{"isbn_13":"9789493169098"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2195,"title":"Wolf Hall","isbn_13":"9789493169098","isbn_10":"949316909X","language":"nld","publisher":"Meridiaan Uitgevers"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789493169098","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789493169098"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-03-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/201724/wolf-hall.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/201724/wolf-hall.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://rozet.nl/catalogus/1982863/","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Independent identity/content corroboration"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000586306_Wolf_Hall_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T23:12:48.776Z","sha256":"5c30413fcc19d4a5246bd980eb4a92392de8b07acf7a6fbbf2815f3b59bc279b","bytes":60269,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789493169098","work_id":2195,"bound_author_id":1086,"bound_title":"Wolf Hall","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789493169098","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000586306_Wolf_Hall_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/201724/wolf-hall.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2195:nl","key":{"work_id":2195,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-03-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/201724/wolf-hall.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/201724/wolf-hall.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://rozet.nl/catalogus/1982863/","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Independent identity/content corroboration"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000586306_Wolf_Hall_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T23:12:48.776Z","sha256":"5c30413fcc19d4a5246bd980eb4a92392de8b07acf7a6fbbf2815f3b59bc279b","bytes":60269,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":2195,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":1086,"text":"Thomas Cromwell probeert zich in het Engeland van Hendrik VIII een plaats aan het hof te verwerven. Zijn afkomst geeft hem weinig vanzelfsprekend gezag, maar hij weet hoe mensen en belangen met elkaar verbonden zijn. Terwijl de koning zijn huwelijk wil beëindigen, veranderen de verhoudingen tussen kerk en staat. Mantel volgt de opkomst van een man die zijn toekomst afhankelijk maakt van inzicht, aanpassingsvermogen en koninklijke gunst.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/201724/wolf-hall.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022575109","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022575109"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2206,"title":"Kou uit het oosten","isbn_13":"9789022575109","isbn_10":"9022575101","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V."}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022575109","key":{"e